<title>AUSTRALIA: Delta Gold appoints new Zimbabwe chief.</title>
<headline>Delta Gold appoints new Zimbabwe chief.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delta Gold NL said on Monday it has appointed Frank Purcell as chief executive officer of its Zimbabwe operations, following the departure of Roy Pitchford.</p>
<p>Delta, which has a 33 percent interest in the Hartley Platinum mine near Harare, said Purcell has more than 30 years' experience in Zimbabwe and South Africa, and was most recently managing director of Lonrho Plc's Zimbabwe mining operations.</p>
<p>The Hartley mine is operated by The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd, which owns the remaining stake.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
